      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable trainers and supportive guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight trainers like Dee, Alex, and Taryn for their patient instruction, breed insight, and encouragement during group classes and private sessions. However, one dissatisfied owner felt their dog received inadequate instruction during a board and train stay."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle socialization for anxious dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners appreciate how staff handle puppies, rescue animals, and reactive dogs with structured routines and thoughtful desensitization. Many report that their pets become noticeably more confident around unfamiliar dogs and people while enjoying their time in day school."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Noticeable obedience and behavioral progress"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize practical progress in foundational commands, leash manners, and crate comfort following kindergarten classes and multi-week training programs. While most owners observe lasting improvements at home, one client reported no learning progress after three weeks."
      }
    }
  ],
